From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexbob0 <alextsmail@pm.me>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:04:44 +0100
Subject: Closed tools per turn: model_options.closed_tools left out of the
 requests and refused

A turn's model_options may name tools that turn must not use (closed_tools, exact names or a prefix ending in *):
its requests to the model leave them out and the dispatcher refuses them, tool_call's underlying tool included.
Everything else is the person's usual turn. Set again at every turn (the direct path's _create_agent, the
TurnRunner's resolved agent), so a cached agent's next turn gets them back. BipAgents closes the media and long
tools in a voice call's turns.

BipAgents patch, documented in hermes/patches/README.md of the BipAgents repository.

Bip-Patch: 0023-closed-tools-per-turn
